      "text": "- Do the scary stuff up front\n- Testing (unit testing, etc.)\n    - the second purpose of developer testing is avoiding defects (epistemic humility)\n    - the first purpose is to check our thinking and invite friction.\n        - we are *asking* for some pain here, because minimizing the pain makes better software.\n\n- 40 hour work week\n- ...",
