      "text": "getting the code in it's current state in front of others\nfor feedback was a BIG FREAKING HARD NASTY DEAL in the past.\nWe have solved that problem.\n\n- Deploying (and reverting) code in environments* is *easy* now.\n    - for me (jeff) the environment is OFTEN production.\n    - it doesn't need to be that. Testing, staging, etc. first.\n    - but we (as developers) don't really care.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "getting the code in it's current state in front of others\nfor feedback was a BIG FREAKING HARD NASTY DEAL in the past.\nWe have solved that problem.\n\n- Deploying (and reverting) code in environments* is *easy* now.\n    - for me (jeff) the environment is OFTEN production.\n    - it doesn't need to be that. Testing, staging, etc. first.\n    - but we (as developers) don't really care.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
